 "title": "Redesign typeface and shape language (approved 2026-11-27): Outfit for UI text, titles and large numerals, Barlow Condensed kept for dense tabular numbers; cards 20, controls 12, tags fully round, a raised thumb shadow for segmented controls. Applied on top of tuning-2026-11-27.json.",
